  "title": "Chilled Walnut and Garlic Soup",
  "blurb": "A creamy cold soup with crushed walnuts and raw garlic, smoothed with cream and served chilled.",
  "steps": [
    "Peel the garlic cloves and crush them with the flat of a knife, then chop finely.",
    "Put the walnuts in a food processor or blender with the garlic and blend until you have a fairly smooth paste.",
    "Add the cream, cold water, salt, pepper and lemon juice, then blend again until completely smooth.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning if needed, then transfer to a bowl or jug.",
    "Cover and chill in the fridge for at least 15 minutes before serving."
